codeExamples.expectedOutput:
As records arrive, lines like:
p0 @ 120: {"order_id": 5001, "amount": 42}
p3 @ 98: {"order_id": 5002, "amount": 17}
Each line shows the partition and offset the record came from; running a second instance of this script in the same group splits partitions between the two and each prints only its assigned partitions.
